---
// Northbay's bus matrix: business processes (rows) against the shared dimensions (columns).
const dims = ['Date', 'Product', 'Store', 'Customer', 'Promotion', 'Employee'];
const procs: [string, string, string[]][] = [
  ['Sales (order lines)', 'transaction', ['Date', 'Product', 'Store', 'Customer', 'Promotion']],
  ['Returns', 'transaction', ['Date', 'Product', 'Store', 'Customer']],
  ['Daily store sales', 'periodic snapshot', ['Date', 'Store']],
  ['Order to return', 'accumulating snapshot', ['Date', 'Product', 'Store', 'Customer']],
  ['Promotion coverage', 'factless', ['Date', 'Store', 'Promotion']],
  ['Staffing (later)', 'periodic snapshot', ['Date', 'Store', 'Employee']],
];
---
<figure class="bmx">
  <div class="bmx-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th class="bmx-p">Business process</th>{dims.map((d) => <th class="bmx-d"><span>{d}</span></th>)}</tr></thead>
      <tbody>{procs.map(([p, kind, has]) => (
        <tr><th class="bmx-p" scope="row">{p}<small>{kind}</small></th>{dims.map((d) => <td>{has.includes(d) ? <span class="bmx-x" aria-label="uses">●</span> : <span class="bmx-o" aria-label="does not use"></span>}</td>)}</tr>
      ))}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Each row is a fact table to build; each column is a dimension built once and shared by every fact table with a dot. Read down a column to see which processes can be compared on it: sales and returns share Date, Product, Store and Customer.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style is:inline>
.bmx { margin: 20px 0; }
.bmx-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
.bmx table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13.5px; margin: 0 auto; }
.bmx th, .bmx td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 4px 6px; }
.bmx td { text-align: center; width: 34px; }
.bmx-p { text-align: left; font-weight: 600; min-width: 128px; }
.bmx-p small { display: block; font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
.bmx thead .bmx-p { vertical-align: bottom; }
.bmx-d { vertical-align: bottom; height: 86px; }
.bmx-d span { writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg); white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
.bmx-x { color: var(--accent); font-size: 15px; }
.bmx figcaption { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
